# Every character of DEC Special Graphics, _ to ~. The first cell holds
# U+00A0, the no-break space; the control pictures, ≤, ≥, π and ≠ draw as
# the replacement glyph, but the model keeps their code points.
size: 32x1
input: \e(0_`abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz{|}~
screen:
| ◆▒␉␌␍␊°±␤␋┘┐┌└┼⎺⎻─⎼⎽├┤┴┬│≤≥π≠£·|
cursor: 1,32 wrap
